DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by kommune — this is the national range. Check th
 e local skolerute.\n\nWinter school break\n\nOne school week in ISO week 8
  OR 9\, set locally (kommune for grunnskole\, fylkeskommune for vgs) under
  opplæringslova § 14-1. The national entry spans both weeks — check th
 e local skolerute.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-0
 9-30
