BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Russetiden
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260420
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260518
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-russetid-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Russ celebration season\n\nTraditionally ~20 April to 17. mai 
 for final-year upper-secondary students (russ). No legal dates. The Govern
 ment aims to move the celebration after exams and from 2026 spreads vg3 wr
 itten exams either side of 17. mai — expect this window to shift\; re-ch
 eck each year. Marketing to russ involves minors: avoid alcohol and pressu
 re tactics.\n\nSource: https://www.regjeringen.no/no/aktuelt/regjeringen-s
 kal-endre-russetiden/id3030864/
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.regjeringen.no/no/aktuelt/regjeringen-skal-endre-russetide
 n/id3030864/
END:VEVENT
