BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Feriepenger utbetales
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260601
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260701
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-feriepenger-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Holiday pay lands\n\nFerieloven § 11: holiday pay is paid on 
 the last regular payday before the holiday — for most employees the June
  salary\, when the ordinary tax deduction is also skipped. Payday varies b
 y employer\, hence the month range.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument
 /NL/lov/1988-04-29-21
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1988-04-29-21
END:VEVENT
