DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260625
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-skoleslutt-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by kommune — this is the national range. Check th
 e local skolerute.\n\nLast day of school\n\nSet in each kommune's skolerut
 e (opplæringslova § 14-1)\; usually a weekday between ~17 and 24 June. O
 slo's last day was Fri 18 June 2027 and is Thu 22 June 2028 — no stable 
 weekday rule\, so a range.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2
 023-06-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
