UID:moment-sankthansaften-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Midsummer Eve\n\nBonfires and grilling on 23 June\; not a publ
 ic holiday (SNL).\n\nSource: https://snl.no/sankthans
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
