BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fellesferie
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260706
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260725
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-fellesferie-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Collective summer holiday\n\nTraditionally ISO weeks 28–30 i
 n July\, recommended by NHO and Fellesforbundet for industry (6–24 July 
 in 2026). Ferieloven § 5 lets employees claim 3 weeks' main holiday betwe
 en 1 June and 30 September (https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/1988-04-29-
 21). B2B goes quiet\; travel\, grilling and cabin peak.\n\nSource: https:/
 /www.thelocal.no/20210702/fellesferie-everything-you-need-to-know-about-no
 rways-collective-holiday-period
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.thelocal.no/20210702/fellesferie-everything-you-need-to-kn
 ow-about-norways-collective-holiday-period
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Skolestart (varierer lokalt)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260810
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260822
DTSTAMP:20261001T080000Z
UID:moment-skolestart-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by kommune — this is the national range. Check th
 e local skolerute.\n\nBack to school\n\nFirst school day is set locally\, 
 usually mid-August (ISO week 33 or 34) — Bergen even varies the weekday 
 (Fri 14 Aug 2026\, Mon 16 Aug 2027)\, so it keeps the national range. Back
 -to-school is also "høstoppstart" for B2B: offices fill up again after fe
 llesferie.\n\nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
END:VEVENT
