UID:moment-hostferie-2026-all@seasonsignal.local
SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Dates vary by kommune — this is the national range. Check th
 e local skolerute.\n\nAutumn school break\n\nOne school week in ISO week 4
 0 or 41\, set locally (e.g. Oslo and Bærum week 40\; Trondheim\, Haugesun
 d and Nord-Aurdal week 41 in 2026). The national entry spans both weeks.\n
 \nSource: https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
LAST-MODIFIED:20261001T080000Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://lovdata.no/dokument/NL/lov/2023-06-09-30
END:VEVENT
