SEQUENCE:919200
CATEGORIES:Moment
DESCRIPTION:Christmas-party season\n\nWorkplace Christmas parties cluster 
 on Friday/Saturday evenings from mid-November to mid-December. No official
  dates\; the range is a planning convention. Venues book up by early autum
 n.\n\nSource: https://snl.no/julebord
